From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TurboVadim <yolkin.vadim@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:45:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve Paper live goal eligibility

Read disabled flags and interruptibility when each goal is evaluated. Keep
the allocation-free array loop, repairing it after callback mutations, and
skip empty flag lookups with an exact mask of locked keys. Restore skeleton
trap removal and remove the obsolete doTrap workaround.

